== Behavior ==
'''Endermen''' in SkyBlock act almost exactly like '''Endermen''' in vanilla Minecraft. They are passive when spawned, and will not attack the player, instead choosing to walk around the area they spawned into randomly. If the player attacks them or looks directly at their head, they will become aggressive, chasing the player around until they touch water, despawn, or die. In SkyBlock and in [[The End]], '''Endermen''' can also become agitated when throwing an {{Item|Ender Pearl}}, but not a {{Item|Silent Pearl}}

'''Endermen''' cannot be attacked using a [[Bow]] or [[Shortbow]] other than the {{Item|Juju Shortbow}} or {{Item|Terminator}}.
