== Trivia ==
*Wearing a {{Item|Pumpkin}} or {{Item|Enderman Mask}} will prevent angering '''Endermen''' by looking at them.
*Similar to in vanilla Minecraft, '''Endermen''' are immune to bows. If hit with an arrow, they won't take damage. Several bows are still able to deal damage to them, most notably the {{Item|Juju Shortbow}} and {{Item|Terminator}}.
*When an Enderman takes damage from water, the damage number is blue.

== Bugs ==
*Killing a {{Zone|Private Island}} Enderman may result in {{Zone|The End}} Enderman bestiary being copied over.

